@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Forehand three-shot sequence
Forehand three-shot sequence, two minutes. Straight drives in turn. Soft, on the service line,
bouncing in the service box. Medium, a racket head above it, bouncing behind the box. Then hard,
just under the service line, so it comes off the back wall.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Soft. Medium. Hard.
1:10 Same preparation every time. Only the swing speed changes.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
